ething is both blue and kind, it must also be rough.\n12.**Rough, kind things are quiet.** This tells us that if something is both rough and kind, it must also be quiet.\n13.**Round things are kind.** This tells us that if something is round, it must also be kind.\n14.**If Anne is round then Anne is kind.** This tells us that if Anne is round, she must also be kind.\nBased on the information provided, Harry is not rough.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
