s the tiger and the mouse is red, then the tiger does not see the squirrel.\n   - If something needs the mouse and the mouse eats the cow, then the cow eats the squirrel.\n   - If something is blue, then it needs the squirrel.The mouse does not eat the mouse.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
