n6.**If something is young then it likes the cow**: This statement does not provide any information about the color of the cow.\n\n7.**If the squirrel likes the cat and the cow does not chase the squirrel then the cat likes the cow**: This statement does not provide any information about the color of the cow.\nThe cow is not red based on the given statements and analysis. Therefore, the statement "The cow is red" is true.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
