 the squirrel.\n   - If something needs the squirrel, then it is green.\n   - If something is young, then it needs the tiger.\n   - Green things are young.\n   - If something is big and it visits the lion, then the lion needs the squirrel.\n   - If the squirrel is big and the squirrel does not like the tiger, then the tiger is not big.The squirrel does visit the lion.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
