ly connection we have is that all round things are green, and this necessarily implies that Dave is not young.\n\n5.**Conclusion**: Based on the given information, we can definitively conclude that Dave is not young. Therefore, the statement "Dave is young" is false.\n\n<｜User｜>Please create a logical reasoning problem. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
